WEBVTT

00:00:01.875 --> 00:00:04.375
<c.Caption-C2_1>Ai, Ai, Ai, I love you!

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.041
<c.Caption-C3_1>Mai, Mai, Mai, my darling!

00:00:07.166 --> 00:00:09.708
<c.Caption-C4_1>Mii, Mii, Mii, help me!

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:14.125
<c.Caption-C5_1>Popotan! Popotan! Popotan!

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.958
<c.Caption-C6_1>When you feel down

00:00:31.416 --> 00:00:33.833
<c.Caption-C7_1>And you are at your wit's end

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:37.625
<c.Caption-C8_1>Ask the Popotan for advice

00:00:39.291 --> 00:00:41.791
<c.Caption-C9_1>Yes, if you can be honest

00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:44.458
<c.Caption-C10_1>And open up your heart

00:00:44.875 --> 00:00:48.708
<c.Caption-C11_1>The Popotan will show the way

00:00:49.041 --> 00:00:51.583
<c.Caption-C12_1>Will he come or not?

00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:54.291
<c.Caption-C13_1>Does he love me or not?

00:00:54.333 --> 00:00:56.916
<c.Caption-C14_1>Is this love true or false?

00:00:57.708 --> 00:01:01.958
<c.Caption-C15_1>They have all the answers

00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:05.416
<c.Caption-C16_1>I can't take it! Po po po!

00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:08.208
<c.Caption-C17_1>I can't take it! Po po po!

00:01:08.916 --> 00:01:13.666
<c.Caption-C18_1>I know, but I just can't stop!

00:01:13.791 --> 00:01:16.208
<c.Caption-C19_1>It's impossible! Po Po Po!

00:01:16.541 --> 00:01:18.625
<c.Caption-C20_1>It's impossible! Po Po Po!

00:01:19.541 --> 00:01:24.458
<c.Caption-C21_1>Even if it's just a dream, never give up!

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:26.666
<c.Caption-C22_1>Popotan!

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:43.333
<c.Subtitle-C2_1>When did that get built there?

00:01:54.041 --> 00:01:56.333
<c.Subtitle-C3_1>I've had this feeling...

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.375
<c.Subtitle-C4_1>Have we been here before?

00:01:58.666 --> 00:02:00.583
<c.Subtitle-C5_1>I know.

00:02:00.583 --> 00:02:02.291
<c.Subtitle-C6_1>I'm sure we were...

00:02:20.041 --> 00:02:21.208
<c.Subtitle-C7_1>Konami?

00:02:25.458 --> 00:02:27.375
<c.Subtitle-C8_1>Konami?! What're you...?!

00:02:27.375 --> 00:02:28.333
<c.Subtitle-C9_1>What?

00:02:28.333 --> 00:02:31.041
<c.Subtitle-C10_1>You look familiar.

00:02:31.375 --> 00:02:33.500
<c.Subtitle-C11_1>It's me! It's me! It's Mai!

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:34.750
<c.Subtitle-C12_1>Have you forgotten?!

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:35.541
<c.Subtitle-C13_1>Mai?

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.875
<c.Subtitle-C14_1>Huh? Aren't you Konami?

00:02:38.166 --> 00:02:39.708
<c.Subtitle-C15_1>What's going on?

00:02:39.708 --> 00:02:42.375
<c.Subtitle-C16_1>You've been calling me Konami

00:02:39.709 --> 00:02:42.375
<c.Subtitle-C16_2>over and over.

00:02:42.375 --> 00:02:44.208
<c.Subtitle-C17_1>Are you a friend of my mother's?

00:02:44.208 --> 00:02:45.500
<c.Subtitle-C18_1>Mother?

00:02:45.541 --> 00:02:48.083
<c.Subtitle-C19_1>Are you Konami's daughter?!

00:02:48.083 --> 00:02:49.750
<c.Subtitle-C20_1>What if I was?

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:51.250
<c.Subtitle-C21_1>You're acting a little too familiar with me.

00:02:52.458 --> 00:02:54.125
<c.Subtitle-C22_1>M-Mai?

00:03:00.208 --> 00:03:04.125
<c.Subtitle-C23_1>We did live here at one time in the past.

00:03:05.166 --> 00:03:07.416
<c.Subtitle-C24_1>To be precise...

00:03:07.416 --> 00:03:12.375
<c.Subtitle-C25_1>...we were living on this spot

00:03:07.417 --> 00:03:12.375
<c.Subtitle-C25_2>40 years ago in 1970.

00:03:18.458 --> 00:03:23.416
<c.Caption-C23_1>One More Time

00:03:26.125 --> 00:03:27.333
<c.Subtitle-C26_1>Good morning!

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:29.875
<c.Subtitle-C27_1>Good morning, Mai.

00:03:30.125 --> 00:03:31.041
<c.Subtitle-C28_1>Good morning.

00:03:38.625 --> 00:03:40.333
<c.Subtitle-C29_1>Hey, Mai.

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:42.375
<c.Subtitle-C30_1>Just leave her alone.

00:03:42.708 --> 00:03:45.166
<c.Subtitle-C31_1>She's always just staring out the window.

00:03:45.208 --> 00:03:47.041
<c.Subtitle-C32_1>She'll ignore you if you try talking to her.

00:03:47.041 --> 00:03:49.000
<c.Subtitle-C33_1>Does she have any friends?

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.416
<c.Subtitle-C34_1>Of course not.

00:03:50.416 --> 00:03:53.083
<c.Subtitle-C35_1>She's so unfriendly. Who'd want to try?

00:03:59.625 --> 00:04:01.291
<c.Subtitle-C36_1>Good morning, Mai!

00:04:03.291 --> 00:04:04.625
<c.Subtitle-C37_1>What're you doing?

00:04:08.791 --> 00:04:12.041
<c.Subtitle-C38_1>Hey, how far have you gotten in math?

00:04:12.375 --> 00:04:15.375
<c.Subtitle-C39_1>I just transferred here.

00:04:12.376 --> 00:04:15.375
<c.Subtitle-C39_2>I don't know what's going on.

00:04:16.041 --> 00:04:18.291
<c.Subtitle-C40_1>Oh, don't be so cold.

00:04:18.291 --> 00:04:21.333
<c.Subtitle-C41_1>I sit next to you, so let's try to be friends.

00:04:21.375 --> 00:04:23.708
<c.Subtitle-C42_1>I mean, we've even got the same name.

00:04:27.083 --> 00:04:29.708
<c.Subtitle-C43_1>I really hate my name.

00:04:29.708 --> 00:04:30.583
<c.Subtitle-C44_1>What?

00:04:31.166 --> 00:04:32.458
<c.Subtitle-C45_1>W-Wait a minute!

00:04:41.458 --> 00:04:43.708
<c.Subtitle-C46_1>Hey, Mai!

00:04:44.583 --> 00:04:45.875
<c.Subtitle-C47_1>Hang on!

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:48.708
<c.Subtitle-C48_1>Let's go home together!

00:04:51.375 --> 00:04:53.708
<c.Subtitle-C49_1>H-Hey! Wait a minute!

00:05:00.208 --> 00:05:02.000
<c.Subtitle-C50_1>Isn't this a really nice town?

00:05:03.041 --> 00:05:04.958
<c.Subtitle-C51_1>Have you joined a club at school?

00:05:09.291 --> 00:05:10.458
<c.Subtitle-C52_1>You draw!

00:05:10.458 --> 00:05:11.791
<c.Subtitle-C53_1>What do you draw?

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.666
<c.Subtitle-C54_1>Come to think of it,

00:05:13.001 --> 00:05:15.666
<c.Subtitle-C54_2>Konami was good at drawing.

00:05:16.666 --> 00:05:18.208
<c.Subtitle-C55_1>That was close.

00:05:18.208 --> 00:05:21.916
<c.Subtitle-C56_1>I may not have changed,

00:05:18.209 --> 00:05:21.916
<c.Subtitle-C56_2>but Konami's 40 years older now.

00:05:22.041 --> 00:05:23.875
<c.Subtitle-C57_1>Um, I was wondering...

00:05:23.916 --> 00:05:25.916
<c.Subtitle-C58_1>How's your mother doing?

00:05:26.708 --> 00:05:29.083
<c.Subtitle-C59_1>Why do I have to tell you that?

00:05:29.416 --> 00:05:30.458
<c.Subtitle-C60_1>Huh?

00:05:31.083 --> 00:05:34.083
<c.Subtitle-C61_1>Who are you?!

00:05:31.084 --> 00:05:34.083
<c.Subtitle-C61_2>What do you want with me?!

00:05:38.125 --> 00:05:39.125
<c.Subtitle-C62_1>Well...

00:05:41.125 --> 00:05:43.083
<c.Subtitle-C63_1>I can't leave you alone.

00:05:43.083 --> 00:05:45.583
<c.Subtitle-C64_1>You're exactly the way I was!

00:05:45.583 --> 00:05:48.333
<c.Subtitle-C65_1>When I was trying my best

00:05:45.584 --> 00:05:48.333
<c.Subtitle-C65_2>not to make friends!

00:05:48.333 --> 00:05:50.166
<c.Subtitle-C66_1>You're just like me!

00:05:50.416 --> 00:05:53.791
<c.Subtitle-C67_1>So you feel sympathetic towards me?

00:05:53.791 --> 00:05:55.250
<c.Subtitle-C68_1>Sounds stupid.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:57.000
<c.Subtitle-C69_1>I'm not like you.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.083
<c.Subtitle-C70_1>I don't need any friends!

00:06:00.041 --> 00:06:01.208
<c.Subtitle-C71_1>Why not?

00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:05.583
<c.Subtitle-C72_1>Because I know someone

00:06:02.334 --> 00:06:05.583
<c.Subtitle-C72_2>who trusted her friend...

00:06:05.583 --> 00:06:07.666
<c.Subtitle-C73_1>...and was betrayed in the end!

00:06:08.208 --> 00:06:09.083
<c.Subtitle-C74_1>Huh?

00:06:09.083 --> 00:06:13.291
<c.Subtitle-C75_1>If being friends is to have your

00:06:09.084 --> 00:06:13.291
<c.Subtitle-C75_2>hopes tied up with someone...

00:06:13.291 --> 00:06:16.375
<c.Subtitle-C76_1>...even when they're far away,

00:06:13.292 --> 00:06:16.375
<c.Subtitle-C76_2>then I don't want that!

00:06:16.666 --> 00:06:18.833
<c.Subtitle-C77_1>I don't want any friends!

00:06:32.458 --> 00:06:35.625
<c.Subtitle-C78_1>What's the matter, Mai?

00:06:32.459 --> 00:06:35.625
<c.Subtitle-C78_2>You're sighing.

00:06:36.541 --> 00:06:37.708
<c.Subtitle-C79_1>Well...

00:06:38.916 --> 00:06:42.375
<c.Subtitle-C80_1>They say that when a young girl

00:06:38.917 --> 00:06:42.375
<c.Subtitle-C80_2>your age sighs...

00:06:42.375 --> 00:06:44.291
<c.Subtitle-C81_1>...there's an 80 percent chance

00:06:42.376 --> 00:06:44.291
<c.Subtitle-C81_2>that it has to do with love.

00:06:45.125 --> 00:06:48.708
<c.Subtitle-C82_1>Oh, my! I guess you're about that age!

00:06:50.125 --> 00:06:51.500
<c.Subtitle-C83_1>N-No!

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:53.208
<c.Subtitle-C84_1>That's not it at all!

00:06:53.208 --> 00:06:54.666
<c.Subtitle-C85_1>That's right, Ai.

00:06:54.666 --> 00:06:56.166
<c.Subtitle-C86_1>Think about it carefully.

00:06:56.166 --> 00:07:00.583
<c.Subtitle-C87_1>Mai falling in love is about as likely as

00:06:56.167 --> 00:07:00.583
<c.Subtitle-C87_2>a polar bear surfing while eating.

00:07:00.583 --> 00:07:02.375
<c.Subtitle-C88_1>It's impossible.

00:07:03.458 --> 00:07:07.208
<c.Subtitle-C89_1>I don't really understand

00:07:03.459 --> 00:07:07.208
<c.Subtitle-C89_2>but I think I get the idea.

00:07:07.208 --> 00:07:09.083
<c.Subtitle-C90_1>Don't you be agreeing.

00:07:09.083 --> 00:07:10.541
<c.Subtitle-C91_1>Gimme a break.

00:07:10.708 --> 00:07:11.833
<c.Subtitle-C92_1>Hey, Ai...

00:07:13.083 --> 00:07:16.791
<c.Subtitle-C93_1>You wouldn't name your daughter

00:07:13.084 --> 00:07:16.791
<c.Subtitle-C93_2>after someone you hate, right?

00:07:17.083 --> 00:07:19.125
<c.Subtitle-C94_1>Mai! Don't tell me...!

00:07:19.125 --> 00:07:21.958
<c.Subtitle-C95_1>You're pregnant before

00:07:19.126 --> 00:07:21.958
<c.Subtitle-C95_2>you've even fallen in love?!

00:07:22.916 --> 00:07:23.625
<c.Subtitle-C96_1>Uh, wha...?!

00:07:23.625 --> 00:07:25.416
<c.Subtitle-C97_1>Who did it?! A man?!

00:07:25.416 --> 00:07:27.083
<c.Subtitle-C98_1>Maybe it's a false pregnancy.

00:07:27.875 --> 00:07:30.875
<c.Subtitle-C99_1>Don't be stupid! There is no baby!

00:07:31.458 --> 00:07:34.541
<c.Subtitle-C100_1>By the way, Miss Mai gets her period

00:07:31.459 --> 00:07:34.541
<c.Subtitle-C100_2>every 27 days on the dot.

00:07:34.541 --> 00:07:37.375
<c.Subtitle-C101_1>There's nothing to worry about.

00:07:38.916 --> 00:07:40.541
<c.Subtitle-C102_1>How does she know that?

00:07:40.541 --> 00:07:42.375
<c.Subtitle-C103_1>How does she know what?

00:07:47.541 --> 00:07:49.916
<c.Subtitle-C104_1>That's got to be your daughter.

00:07:50.416 --> 00:07:53.291
<c.Subtitle-C105_1>You're both similar in your stubborn ways.

00:07:54.291 --> 00:07:58.750
<c.Subtitle-C106_1>I wonder if you felt the way

00:07:54.292 --> 00:07:58.750
<c.Subtitle-C106_2>I'm feeling, Konami?

00:08:03.083 --> 00:08:04.666
<c.Subtitle-C107_1>Uh, good morning.

00:08:06.833 --> 00:08:09.333
<c.Subtitle-C108_1>She's really weird.

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.750
<c.Subtitle-C109_1>Good morning, Mai!

00:08:15.791 --> 00:08:18.250
<c.Subtitle-C110_1>Wh-What're you trying to do?!

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:19.500
<c.Subtitle-C111_1>Darn.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:21.083
<c.Subtitle-C112_1>Maybe I went a bit too far.

00:08:28.208 --> 00:08:28.958
<c.Subtitle-C113_1>Wh-What?!

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:31.416
<c.Subtitle-C114_1>I have no partner, too.

00:08:31.791 --> 00:08:33.000
<c.Subtitle-C115_1>Let's work together.

00:08:33.041 --> 00:08:35.041
<c.Subtitle-C116_1>But you seem pretty flexible.

00:08:35.041 --> 00:08:37.041
<c.Subtitle-C117_1>You should do gymnastics.

00:08:37.041 --> 00:08:38.333
<c.Subtitle-C118_1>J-Just leave me alone!

00:08:45.041 --> 00:08:46.208
<c.Subtitle-C119_1>Hey, hey...

00:08:46.833 --> 00:08:48.791
<c.Subtitle-C120_1>Can I see your textbook?

00:08:48.791 --> 00:08:50.041
<c.Subtitle-C121_1>I forgot mine at home.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:51.416
<c.Subtitle-C122_1>Oh, come on!

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:53.333
<c.Subtitle-C123_1>Please! I'm serious!

00:08:53.375 --> 00:08:55.791
<c.Subtitle-C124_1>Oh, I know. I'll buy you ice cream.

00:08:55.916 --> 00:08:59.500
<c.Subtitle-C125_1>You can have a double or even a triple

00:08:55.917 --> 00:08:59.500
<c.Subtitle-C125_2>of whatever flavor you want!

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:00.500
<c.Subtitle-C126_1>So, please!

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:01.791
<c.Subtitle-C127_1>Now, cut it out!

00:09:01.791 --> 00:09:02.833
<c.Subtitle-C128_1>I...

00:09:08.125 --> 00:09:09.333
<c.Subtitle-C129_1>Uh, I'm sorry.

00:09:11.333 --> 00:09:12.958
<c.Subtitle-C130_1>H-Hang on!

00:09:13.416 --> 00:09:15.333
<c.Subtitle-C131_1>I'm sorry! I regret it!

00:09:15.333 --> 00:09:17.125
<c.Subtitle-C132_1>Please forgive me!

00:09:18.333 --> 00:09:21.750
<c.Subtitle-C133_1>I'm dead serious.

00:09:18.334 --> 00:09:21.750
<c.Subtitle-C133_2>Don't ever come near me again!

00:09:27.541 --> 00:09:30.041
<c.Subtitle-C134_1>This isn't going very well.

00:09:30.041 --> 00:09:32.625
<c.Subtitle-C135_1>Are you trying to repay a debt?

00:09:35.291 --> 00:09:36.291
<c.Subtitle-C136_1>You!

00:09:36.833 --> 00:09:38.333
<c.Subtitle-C137_1>What're you doing here?!

00:09:41.041 --> 00:09:43.666
<c.Subtitle-C138_1>You want to pay back to the daughter...

00:09:43.666 --> 00:09:47.166
<c.Subtitle-C139_1>...a debt you incurred with

00:09:43.667 --> 00:09:47.166
<c.Subtitle-C139_2>her mother 40 years ago?

00:09:47.458 --> 00:09:49.208
<c.Subtitle-C140_1>I can't leave her alone.

00:09:49.666 --> 00:09:51.333
<c.Subtitle-C141_1>I see myself in her.

00:09:52.375 --> 00:09:56.000
<c.Subtitle-C142_1>So you're going to do all that

00:09:52.376 --> 00:09:56.000
<c.Subtitle-C142_2>and then abandon her?

00:09:57.250 --> 00:09:58.500
<c.Subtitle-C143_1>What do you mean?

00:09:59.333 --> 00:10:02.958
<c.Subtitle-C144_1>I don't think you're aware of

00:09:59.334 --> 00:10:02.958
<c.Subtitle-C144_2>the crime you committed.

00:10:02.958 --> 00:10:05.791
<c.Subtitle-C145_1>You're always traveling

00:10:02.959 --> 00:10:05.791
<c.Subtitle-C145_2>across time and space...

00:10:05.791 --> 00:10:08.375
<c.Subtitle-C146_1>...and you abandon your

00:10:05.792 --> 00:10:08.375
<c.Subtitle-C146_2>friends every time.

00:10:08.791 --> 00:10:12.791
<c.Subtitle-C147_1>You make promises about reuniting

00:10:08.792 --> 00:10:12.791
<c.Subtitle-C147_2>with friends you've made.

00:10:12.791 --> 00:10:16.166
<c.Subtitle-C148_1>I don't think you realize

00:10:12.792 --> 00:10:16.166
<c.Subtitle-C148_2>what a terrible crime that is.

00:10:16.166 --> 00:10:17.166
<c.Subtitle-C149_1>What?!

00:10:17.333 --> 00:10:20.333
<c.Subtitle-C150_1>You just carry on with your journey.

00:10:20.333 --> 00:10:24.416
<c.Subtitle-C151_1>Not only are you hurting yourself,

00:10:20.334 --> 00:10:24.416
<c.Subtitle-C151_2>but you're hurting others as well.

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.875
<c.Subtitle-C152_1>Wh-What are you going on about?

00:10:36.875 --> 00:10:38.541
<c.Subtitle-C153_1>Just stay away from me!

00:10:44.708 --> 00:10:45.791
<c.Subtitle-C154_1>Popotan.

00:10:49.708 --> 00:10:50.833
<c.Subtitle-C155_1>Popotan.

00:10:51.958 --> 00:10:52.958
<c.Subtitle-C156_1>Good morning!

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:54.375
<c.Subtitle-C157_1>Good morning!

00:10:54.375 --> 00:10:55.541
<c.Subtitle-C158_1>Good morning, Mai!

00:10:56.625 --> 00:10:58.000
<c.Subtitle-C159_1>Good morning, Mai.

00:10:58.041 --> 00:11:02.583
<c.Subtitle-C160_1>Guess what? My little sister brought home

00:10:58.042 --> 00:11:02.583
<c.Subtitle-C160_2>a purse crab and it was terrible!

00:11:02.583 --> 00:11:05.083
<c.Subtitle-C161_1>It got into a fight with our ferret!

00:11:09.125 --> 00:11:10.708
<c.Subtitle-C162_1>Oh, is that so?

00:11:11.833 --> 00:11:13.208
<c.Subtitle-C163_1>Thank you very much.

00:11:13.708 --> 00:11:16.416
<c.Subtitle-C164_1>It's been a long time for me, too.

00:11:16.416 --> 00:11:18.791
<c.Subtitle-C165_1>But it's really no harm.

00:11:18.958 --> 00:11:21.500
<c.Subtitle-C166_1>Ai, why are you dressed like that?

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:22.500
<c.Subtitle-C167_1>Huh?

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:27.791
<c.Subtitle-C168_1>Oh, the Popotan said that they'd

00:11:22.501 --> 00:11:27.791
<c.Subtitle-C168_2>like to see me like this, so...

00:11:29.875 --> 00:11:31.041
<c.Subtitle-C169_1>Good job!

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:33.708
<c.Subtitle-C170_1>So, did you find anything out?

00:11:34.166 --> 00:11:36.250
<c.Subtitle-C171_1>Well, not yet.

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:40.416
